# Screenshots from `node screenshot.mjs`. Never committed: the capture is taken from a
# running harness, so it shows whatever routes and model inventory that harness has —
# which is the maintainer's own deployment, not something to publish. Run the script to
# generate them locally. Those captures are named panel-<theme>.png / picker-<theme>.png
# with a theme suffix.
docs/panel-*.png
docs/picker-*.png

# The synthetic renders (`node preview.mjs --png docs`) are the exception: they are
# rendered from an invented catalogue, so they name no real route, and they are what
# the README publishes. Everything else in docs/ stays local.
docs/*
!docs/panel.png
!docs/picker.png

# Dependencies, if this package is ever developed in place.
node_modules/
package-lock.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
yarn.lock
.pnpm-store/

# Editor and OS noise.
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
